WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,270 --> 00:00:01,870
I won't be poisoned, right?

2
00:00:01,870 --> 00:00:03,070
me too

3
00:00:03,070 --> 00:00:04,070
Feeling dizzy

4
00:00:04,070 --> 00:00:06,070
