10
00:00:17,170 --> 00:00:45,490
This is the Manila Room

11
00:00:45,490 --> 00:00:47,640
Are we safe?

12
00:00:47,640 --> 00:00:49,840
The intelligence says there are no abnormal corpses here.

13
00:00:49,840 --> 00:00:51,240
should be safe
